# jtt export: see docs/commands/export.md.
Output docs/commands/gifs/export.gif
Set Height 460
Set Width 1280
Source docs/tapes/_setup.tape

Type "jtt export -k contributions -o september.csv --from 2026-09-01 --to 2026-10-01" Sleep 500ms Enter Sleep 2000ms
Type "cat september.csv" Sleep 500ms Enter Sleep 5000ms
